[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Core Systems[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Scare Events[/B] – Randomly trigger harmless but atmospheric effects such as lightning, darkness, fire flashes, Slenderman encounters, and Herobrine appearances.
[*][B]Boss Battles[/B] – Summonable Pumpkin Zombie and Skeleton bosses with multiple combat phases, minion spawns, and configurable rewards.
[*][B]Grave System[/B] – Build player graves to summon undead armies through an animated ritual sequence, complete with wave progression, a wave bar and a glowing treasure chest.
[*][B]Pumpkin Buffs[/B] – Wearing a carved pumpkin grants temporary configurable potion effects with optional glowing visuals.
[*][B]Sound System[/B] – Play from sixteen curated horror sounds directly via commands for custom events or ambience.
[*][B]Bat Transformation Event[/B] – Bats can transform into witches with enhanced health, potion drops, and pumpkin rewards.
[*][B]Player Management[/B] – Each player can enable or disable personal Halloween participation, ensuring event flexibility across servers.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Key Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Modular event control: enable or disable any system individually.
[*]Safe upgrades: config and messages are smart-merged – your values, comments and custom messages are kept (v3.0.5+).
[*]World blacklist: keep events out of the Nether / End or any world you choose.
[*]Smart XP scaling for fair progression rewards.
[*]Optimized entity management and cleanup utilities.
[*]Cinematic animations for graves and boss spawns.
[*]100% translatable: every text (events, help, admin feedback) is in [FONT=courier new]messages.yml[/FONT] with [FONT=courier new]&[/FONT]/hex colours and case-insensitive placeholders.
[*]Vanish & spectator aware: hidden staff get no events and are never named in broadcasts.
[*]Season scheduler, witching hour, [FONT=courier new]/halloween trigger[/FONT], Discord webhook (v3.4.0).
[*]Statistics & leaderboards with PlaceholderAPI, boss bars & titles, WorldGuard region flag (v3.4.0).
[*]Flexible rewards (items, commands, Vault money, candy) and a candy economy with a configurable Pumpkin Trader (v3.4.0).
[*]No external dependencies required.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Configuration Example[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
config_version: "3.4.0"

command_prefix: "halloween"

broadcast_events: false

worlds_blacklist:
  - nether
  - world_nether
  - the_end
  - world_the_end

player_filters:
  respect_vanish: true
  skip_spectators: true

login_pumpkin:
  enabled: true
  cooldown_minutes: 30

login_messages:
  enabled: true
  sound: true

helmet_rewards:
  enabled: true
  first_reward_minutes: 5
  increment_minutes: 5
  max_minutes: 30

pumpkin_zombie_boss:
  enabled: true
  cooldown_minutes: 10
  health: 100.0
  damage_boost: 2.0
  speed_boost: 0.3
  xp_reward: 10
  rewards:
    - material: CARVED_PUMPKIN
      min: 15
      max: 20
    - material: CAKE
      min: 3
      max: 5
    - material: PHANTOM_MEMBRANE
      min: 1
      max: 5
    - material: ZOMBIE_HEAD
      min: 1
      max: 1
      chance: 0.3
    - material: GLOWSTONE_DUST
      min: 10
      max: 32

pumpkin_skeleton_boss:
  enabled: true
  cooldown_minutes: 10
  health: 100.0
  damage_boost: 3.0
  speed_boost: 0.3
  xp_reward: 15
  bat_spawn_interval: 10
  phantom_spawn_interval: 60
  minion_range: 20
  rewards:
    - material: CARVED_PUMPKIN
      min: 15
      max: 30
    - material: PHANTOM_MEMBRANE
      min: 2
      max: 4
    - material: ANCIENT_DEBRIS
      min: 1
      max: 2
    - material: POTION
      min: 1
      max: 1

random_pumpkin_mobs:
  enabled: true
  chance: 0.10
  pumpkin_drops:
    min: 1
    max: 3

pumpkin_villager:
  enabled: true
  trades:                       # item: any material, or CANDY = Halloween Candy
    - cost:   { item: EMERALD, amount: 1 }
      result: { item: CARVED_PUMPKIN, amount: 64 }
      max_uses: 999999
    - cost:   { item: CANDY, amount: 10 }
      result: { item: GOLDEN_APPLE, amount: 1 }
      max_uses: 5

candy:
  enabled: true
  material: COOKIE
  name: "&6&lHalloween Candy"
  edible: false
  drops:
    grave_mob:          { chance: 0.25, min: 1, max: 1 }
    boss_defeat:        { chance: 1.0,  min: 5, max: 10 }

bat_transformation:
  enabled: true
  chance: 0.33
  health_multiplier: 1.5
  message: "§5§l✦ §dThe bat transforms into a witch! §5§l✦"
  xp_reward: 5
  rewards:
    pumpkins_min: 3
    pumpkins_max: 8
    potion_drop: true

events:
  pumpkin:
    enabled: true
    min: 5
    max: 20
    enable_pumpkin_surprise: true
    pumpkin_surprise_count: 3

  slenderman:
    enabled: true
    min: 15
    max: 40

  fire:
    enabled: true
    min: 30
    max: 60
    damage_enabled: false

  lightning:
    enabled: true
    min: 20
    max: 35
    damage_enabled: false

  darkness:
    enabled: true
    min: 10
    max: 50
    duration_seconds: 2

  herobrine:
    enabled: true
    min: 40
    max: 80
    render_distance: 3

pumpkin_buffs:
  enabled: true
  glowing: true
  duration: 15

  effects:
    - type: HASTE
      level: 2
      enabled: false
    - type: SPEED
      level: 2
      enabled: true
    - type: STRENGTH
      level: 2
      enabled: false
    - type: REGENERATION
      level: 2
      enabled: true
    - type: RESISTANCE
      level: 2
      enabled: false
    - type: JUMP_BOOST
      level: 2
      enabled: false

grave:
  enabled: true
  cooldown_minutes: 15
  wave_timeouts:
    wave1: 90
    wave2: 120
    wave3: 180
  spawns:
    wave1:
      skeleton: 3
      zombie: 2
      skeleton_horse: 2
      zombie_horse: 3
    wave2:
      skeleton: 5
      zombie: 7
      skeleton_horse: 3
      zombie_horse: 4
    wave3:
      skeleton: 10
      zombie: 8
      blaze: 3
      skeleton_horse: 6
  health_boost: 1.3
  damage_boost: 1.5
  speed_boost: 0.2
  chest_glow: { enabled: true, minutes: 15 }
  pumpkin_drop_chance: 0.10
  pumpkin_drops_per_mob: 1
  xp_per_mob: 5
  rewards:                      # also: - command: "give %player% ..." / - money: 100 / - candy: 5
    - material: CARVED_PUMPKIN
      min: 10
      max: 32
    - material: CAKE
      min: 2
      max: 5
    - material: SKELETON_SKULL
      min: 0
      max: 1
      chance: 0.5
    - material: ZOMBIE_HEAD
      min: 0
      max: 1
      chance: 0.5
    - material: DIAMOND
      min: 5
      max: 10
    - material: ANCIENT_DEBRIS
      min: 1
      max: 3
    - material: PHANTOM_MEMBRANE
      min: 1
      max: 1

season:
  enabled: false
  start: "10-01"
  end: "11-05"
  countdown_days: 7

witching_hour:
  enabled: false
  mode: real                    # real (server clock) or minecraft (world time)
  start: "20:00"
  end: "22:00"
  interval_multiplier: 0.5

discord:
  enabled: false
  webhook_url: ""

statistics:
  enabled: true
  player_visible: [scares, pumpkins_received, halloween_mob_kills, bosses_defeated, graves_completed, cakes, candy_earned]
  top_public: true
  season_end_top: 3

visuals:
  boss_bar: { enabled: true, radius: 40 }
  titles:   { enabled: true, boss_spawn: true, wave_start: true, grave_complete: true }

worldguard:
  enabled: true                 # region flag halloween-events (when WorldGuard is installed)

update_checker:
  enabled: true
  message: "§6[Halloween] §eNew update available!\n§7Current: §c%current_version% §7→ Latest: §a%new_version%\n§eDownload: %link%"
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Commands[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween on[/FONT] – Enable all events globally.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween off[/FONT] – Disable all events and remove active entities (bosses, grave waves, witches).
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween reload[/FONT] – Reload configuration, messages and player data.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween set <event> <min> <max>[/FONT] – Adjust event timing or disable an event.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween sound <player|@a> <sound>[/FONT] – Play horror sounds to selected players.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween cleanup [all][/FONT] – Remove spawned bosses, mobs, and optional traders.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween enable|disable[/FONT] – Turn Halloween on/off for yourself.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween buffs list|toggle|add|remove|level[/FONT] – Manage the pumpkin helmet buffs.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween stats [player][/FONT], [FONT=courier new]/halloween top <stat>[/FONT] – Statistics and leaderboards.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween trigger <event> [player|@a][/FONT] – Fire any event or boss now.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween candy give <player> <amount>[/FONT] – Hand out Halloween Candy.
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween debug eligible [player][/FONT] – Why does a player (not) get events?
[*][FONT=courier new]/halloween reset <pumpkin|helmet|cooldowns|all> [player][/FONT] – Reset one-time rewards or boss/grave cooldowns.
[*][FONT=courier new]/hlw[/FONT] – Short alias; the command name itself can be changed via [FONT=courier new]command_prefix[/FONT].
[/LIST]
Read more in the documentation tab.

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Permissions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[table]
[tr][th]Permission[/th][th]Default[/th][th]Description[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.base[/td][td]true[/td][td]Player commands: help, enable, disable[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.use[/td][td]OP[/td][td]Admin commands: on/off, reload, set, reset, buffs, sound, cleanup[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.admin[/td][td]OP[/td][td]Receives the in-game "update available" notice on join[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.stats[/td][td]true[/td][td]Own statistics and the public leaderboard[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.stats.admin[/td][td]OP[/td][td]Any player's statistics[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]halloween.trigger[/td][td]OP[/td][td]/halloween trigger[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Installation[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Place the plugin JAR into the server’s [FONT=courier new]plugins/[/FONT] directory.
[*]Restart the server to generate configuration files in [FONT=courier new]plugins/Halloween_Softici/[/FONT].
[*]Edit [FONT=courier new]config.yml[/FONT] and [FONT=courier new]messages.yml[/FONT] to your preference.
[*]Run [FONT=courier new]/halloween reload[/FONT] or restart to apply changes.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Upgrading[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[B]From v3.0.5 or newer (drop-in):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Stop the server, replace the JAR, start.
[*][FONT=courier new]config.yml[/FONT] is smart-merged: your values and comments are kept, only new sections/keys are added.
[*][FONT=courier new]messages.yml[/FONT] keeps every category you customized; new categories are appended. A YAML typo in the file no longer wipes it – the plugin logs the line/column, leaves the file untouched and uses default messages until you fix it and run [FONT=courier new]/halloween reload[/FONT].
[*][FONT=courier new]data.yml[/FONT] (player opt-outs, global on/off) is never touched.
[/LIST]
[B]From v3.0.0 – v3.0.4:[/B] config is replaced with fresh defaults, the old file is kept as [FONT=courier new]config.old_<timestamp>.yml[/FONT] – copy your values back manually. messages.yml and data.yml are preserved.

[B]From v1.x / v2.x (folder [FONT=courier new]plugins/Halloween/[/FONT]):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Backup [FONT=courier new]plugins/Halloween/[/FONT], replace the JAR, start the server.
[*]A fresh config is generated in [FONT=courier new]plugins/Halloween_Softici/[/FONT]. The old structure ([FONT=courier new]intervals:[/FONT], old boss section names) is [B]not converted[/B] – re-apply your custom values by hand.
[*]Optional: copy [FONT=courier new]data.yml[/FONT] to [FONT=courier new]Halloween_Softici/[/FONT] to keep player preferences.
[*]Delete the old [FONT=courier new]plugins/Halloween/[/FONT] folder once everything works (it only triggers a startup notice).
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]Technical Information[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Current version: 3.4.0 (config version 3.4.0)
[*]Optional integrations: Vault (money rewards), PlaceholderAPI (placeholders), WorldGuard (halloween-events flag)
[*]Spigot / Paper / Purpur: [B]1.21.3 or newer[/B], including Minecraft 26.1 / 26.2. [I]26.3: builds and runs on Paper 26.3 alpha in our tests - expected to work, but Paper 26.3 is still alpha, so no promises until it goes stable.[/I]
[*]Java: [B]21 or newer[/B] (Paper 26.x itself requires Java 25)
[*]Servers on 1.21.1 / 1.21.2: use v3.1.1
[*]Smart config/messages merge on upgrade (v3.0.5+), timestamped backup when a full replace is needed
[*]Unique plugin folder ([FONT=courier new]Halloween_Softici[/FONT]) prevents conflicts with other Halloween add-ons
[*]No external dependencies, optimized for low performance overhead
[*]Source code & downloads: [URL='https://gitlab.com/softici/halloween']gitlab.com/softici/halloween[/URL] (Releases)
[/LIST]

